###

# Proxy endpoint tests

### Proxy - GET request
GET http://localhost:80/api/Kobo/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/v1/library/sync
Accept: application/json

###

### Proxy - GET with additional path segments
GET http://localhost:80/api/Kobo/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/v1/library/books/12345
Accept: application/json

###

### Proxy - POST request with body
POST http://localhost:80/api/Kobo/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/v1/library/tags
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test-tag",
  "value": "test-value"
}

###

### Proxy - PUT request with body
PUT http://localhost:80/api/Kobo/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/v1/library/books/12345
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title"
}

###

### Proxy - DELETE request
DELETE http://localhost:80/api/Kobo/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/v1/library/books/12345
Accept: application/json

